sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User (web app)
    participant API as Lambda API
    participant DB as Supabase (PostgreSQL)
    participant Auth as Supabase Auth
    User->>API: POST /auth/refresh with session cookie
    API->>DB: Claim this session's refresh
    DB-->>API: Refresh claimed
    API->>Auth: Exchange refresh token
    Auth-->>API: New access and refresh tokens
    API->>DB: Check membership and save refresh result
    DB-->>API: Membership current, result saved
    API-->>User: 200 OK and renewed session cookies
